{"id":1392860,"shortDescription":"Little Nightmares III es una perturbadora aventura atmosférica en la que los grandes amigos Low y Alone, que quieren huir de la Nada, colaborarán para resolver puzles y sobrevivir en un mundo de pesadilla, tanto en el cooperativo online para 2 jugadores como en el modo de un jugador con la I.A.","developers":["Supermassive Games"],"publishers":["Bandai Namco Entertainment"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Cooperativo","Cooperativo en línea","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Tamaño del texto ajustable","Comodidad de la cámara","Alternativas de color","Controles de volumen personalizados","Se recomienda usar un mando","Opción solo teclado","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Compatible con DualShock","Compatible con DualSense","Sonido estéreo","Sonido envolvente","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"9 OCT 2025","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1790849221","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/d0802b426b1116c4d0f7c92cc81de359bc342345/ss_d0802b426b1116c4d0f7c92cc81de359bc342345.600x338.jpg?t=1790849221","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/d0802b426b1116c4d0f7c92cc81de359bc342345/ss_d0802b426b1116c4d0f7c92cc81de359bc342345.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790849221"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/2895b195f79c30ae097dd4525301288b97ac0c95/ss_2895b195f79c30ae097dd4525301288b97ac0c95.600x338.jpg?t=1790849221","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/2895b195f79c30ae097dd4525301288b97ac0c95/ss_2895b195f79c30ae097dd4525301288b97ac0c95.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790849221"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1392860/bb507b20463211ae9c76e09b950f0a70f8213afa/ss_bb507b20463211ae9c76e09b950f0a70f8213afa.600x338.jpg?t=